<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | Souk Al-Mubarakiya" description="How this independent guide uses optional Google Analytics, Cloudflare performance measurements, maps and local storage." path="/en/privacy/" lang="en">
<section class="legal section"><div class="wrap narrow cookie-wrap"><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p class="updated">Updated: 23 October 2026</p><p class="lead">This is an independent visitor guide, not the market operator. It has no account, booking or contact form.</p><h2>Google Analytics choices</h2><p>Google Analytics loads only when a saved analytics choice is enabled. Use Cookie Settings to change it. Withdrawal denies the current page runtime immediately and attempts to clear analytics cookies; the page reports if storage cannot confirm the choice. Previously transmitted data is not recalled.</p><h2>Cloudflare</h2><p>Hosting independently includes a Cloudflare performance beacon for page-load timing. The Google Analytics choice does not control this hosting service. A script appearing in a page does not establish that metrics were successfully delivered. <a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/data-metrics/data-origin-and-collection/">Cloudflare: data origin and collection</a>.</p><h2>Other resources and storage</h2><p>The embedded Google Map contacts Google. Weather is obtained server-side from Open-Meteo for the market area; it does not require your device location. Photos are hosted locally. Local storage records your analytics choice. A service worker caches pages and assets for offline use; browser settings can clear this cache and stored choices. No interface preference feature is currently implemented.</p><p><a href="/en/">Visitor guide</a> · <a href="/en/privacy/">Privacy</a> · <a href="/en/cookies/">Cookie Settings</a></p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.narrow{max-width:850px}.legal h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,7vw,5.8rem);line-height:1;margin:.5rem 0}.updated{color:#7b6757}.intro{padding:24px;margin:34px 0}.intro p{margin:0;font-size:1.08rem}.legal h2{font-size:1.5rem;margin-top:42px;color:#4c3020}.legal p,.legal li{color:#5f4d3f}.legal a{color:#714426;font-weight:700}</style>
